 "etapas": [
  {
   "etapa": "explicar",
   "piezas": [
    {
     "tipo": "explicacion",
     "titulo": "Comparatives",
     "texto": [
      "**Лучше** means «better», **медленнее** «more slowly» and **важнее** «more important». In the text, **медленнее** modifies the verb **бегает**."
     ],
     "tutora": ""
    },
    {
     "tipo": "explicacion",
     "titulo": "Comparing with «than»",
     "texto": [
      "In these sentences, what is compared goes in the genitive: **лучше меня** (better than me) and **важнее денег** (more important than money). **Меня** has the same form in the accusative and the genitive; here it is the genitive.",
      "**Следить за** («to take care of, to watch over») takes the instrumental in this use: **за здоровьем** (for health)."
     ],
     "tutora": ""
    }
   ]
  },
